<title>UK: Spintab sets 700 mln Danish crown domestic bond.</title>
<headline>Spintab sets 700 mln Danish crown domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spintab has brought a 700 million Danish crown five-year domestic bond paying 4.00 percent, lead manager BG Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>The issue price was undisclosed. The deal will be listed in Copenhagen.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
